* Select

The ⟪GTI18N_8d8de56f_000001⟫select⟪GTI18N_8d8de56f_000002⟫ statement lets a goroutine wait on multiple communication operations.

A ⟪GTI18N_8d8de56f_000003⟫select⟪GTI18N_8d8de56f_000004⟫ blocks until one of its cases can run, then it executes that case.  It chooses one at random if multiple are ready.

